									"sequenceNumber": "45",
									"documentation": "Common existing ProductResult for the selected ModifyTourProduct/DeleteTourProduct: application/validation refusal leaves the product unchanged; confirmed transaction commit yields success. Lookup/write errors and unknown outcomes follow the footer. Success updates the existing productList/selectedProduct; no new result field or operation is introduced.",
